      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sigh... gerrit dropped a huge comment due to getting auto logged out of GAIA account (due to timeouts?)\n\nLong story short, I was asking for examples of how to capture conflicts and what was done to address conflicts. And also explanation of what would constitute a BACKPORT -- will a conflict fix up to handle changes in context lines/comments constitute a BACKPORT or not (I\u0027d say not).",
